### 1. Get All Categories (Authenticated User)
GET {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###

### 2. Create a New Category (Admin Only)
POST {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}/categorias
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
    "nombre": "Estadística",
    "paes": "M2"
}

###

### 3. Get Category by ID (Authenticated User)
# Replace with an actual category ID from creation.
GET {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}/categorias/ID_DE_UNA_CATEGORIA_EXISTENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

###

### 4. Update Category (Admin Only)
# Replace with the ID of the category to update.
PUT {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}/categorias/ID_DE_UNA_CATEGORIA_EXISTENTE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

{
    "nombre": "Probabilidad",
    "paes": "M1"
}

###

### 5. Delete Category (Admin Only)
# Replace with the ID of the category to delete.
DELETE {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}/categorias/ID_DE_UNA_CATEGORIA_EXISTENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###